"username":"PeterRFB"},{"end":157,"id":"2351126707","start":142,"username":"DrJasonCarroll"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/8xPom2cRs7","end":295,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112612870383132700/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112612490043396096","start":272,"url":"https://t.co/8xPom2cRs7"}]},"id":"2112612870383132700","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1030,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Suppose you have grown children and want grandkids.\n\nIs there a benefit to verbally encouraging them to have children?\n\nResearch by @PeterRFB @DrJasonCarroll and I suggests the answer is.... yes! Parental encouragement has BIG effects on coupled intentions in particular! https://t.co/8xPom2cRs7","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112612870383132700"},{"author_id":"17217640","created_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112605939375419887"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"We're giving a preview of two upcoming spacewalks on Oct. 29 and No...","display_url":"youtube.com/watch?v=UleiRd…","end":269,"expanded_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UleiRdWFG7o","images":[{"height":720,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112604766677426176/kHg13dRO?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1280},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112604766677426176/kHg13dRO?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":246,"status":200,"title":"U.S. Spacewalk Preview News Conference (Oct. 20, 2026)","unwound_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UleiRdWFG7o","url":"https://t.co/WDuK4zRe8b"}]},"id":"2112605939375419887","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6325,"like_count":22,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"This afternoon, NASA is giving a briefing on the upcoming U.S. Spacewalks 100 and 101, which will be used to install the final ISS Roll-Out Solar Arrays to help increase the power generation on the space station.\n\nFollow this thread for updates.\nhttps://t.co/WDuK4zRe8b","url":"https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2112605939375419887"},{"author_id":"11348282","created_at":"2026-10-20T18:00:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112604875452223824"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":86,"id":"1456357980216066048","start":75,"username":"astro_anil"}],"urls":[{"description":"U.S. Spacewalk Preview News Conference","display_url":"x.com/i/broadcasts/1…","end":226,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/broadcasts/1jxXgBNWypPJZ","images":[{"height":2160,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112604790148694016/L-TFtXGU?format=jpg&name=orig","width":3840},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112604790148694016/L-TFtXGU?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":203,"status":200,"title":"NASA","unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/broadcasts/1jxXgBNWypPJZ","url":"https://t.co/mBmrbnL1j4"}]},"id":"2112604875452223824","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":28,"impression_count":230375,"like_count":506,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":42,"retweet_count":79},"text":"LIVE: Get a preview of two upcoming spacewalks set for Oct. 29 and Nov. 5. @astro_anil and CSA (Canadian Space Agency) astronaut Joshua Kutryk will use both spacewalks to finish installing solar arrays. https://t.co/mBmrbnL1j4","url":"https://x.com/NASA/status/2112604875452223824"},{"author_id":"11348282","created_at":"2026-10-20T18:00:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112604787539865876"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"U.S. Spacewalk Preview News Conference","display_url":"x.com/i/broadcasts/1…","end":62,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/broadcasts/1jxXgBNWypPJZ","images":[{"height":2160,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112604790148694016/L-TFtXGU?format=jpg&name=orig","width":3840},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112604790148694016/L-TFtXGU?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":39,"status":200,"title":"NASA","unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/broadcasts/1jxXgBNWypPJZ","url":"https://t.co/IZfATk2gqE"}]},"id":"