rl":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112602205979025837"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T17:28:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112596736531157267"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"link.springer.com/content/pdf/10…","end":148,"expanded_url":"https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/s10887-026-09273-x.pdf","start":125,"status":303,"unwound_url":"https://idp.springer.com/authorize?response_type=cookie&client_id=springerlink&redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Flink.springer.com%2Fcontent%2Fpdf%2F10.1007%2Fs10887-026-09273-x.pdf%3F","url":"https://t.co/IJolDFzzu5"}]},"id":"2112596736531157267","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":968,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":2},"text":"this paper finally came out! very cool work showing that economic volatility reduces fertility, not just economic bad times! https://t.co/IJolDFzzu5","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112596736531157267"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112594945894674434","3_2112595099448115200"]},"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T17:21:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112595132172108143"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":146,"id":"1600613745453158401","start":135,"username":"MoreBirths"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"link.springer.com/content/pdf/10…","end":235,"expanded_url":"https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1186/s41118-026-00299-y_reference.pdf","start":212,"unwound_url":"https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1186/s41118-026-00299-y_reference.pdf?error=cookies_not_supported&code=a123ca26-f4f5-4b27-ac1b-a6a421fae36c","url":"https://t.co/S5gNBy17hq"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/iALqFAi1c1","end":259,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112595132172108143/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112594945894674434","start":236,"url":"https://t.co/iALqFAi1c1"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/iALqFAi1c1","end":259,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112595132172108143/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112595099448115200","start":236,"url":"https://t.co/iALqFAi1c1"}]},"id":"2112595132172108143","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1260,"like_count":6,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"New study in Japan shows that if you tell people fertility is EXPECTED TO DECLINE...\n\n.... they REDUCE their fertility intentions!\n\ncc @MoreBirths maybe we don't want to spread the news about fertility decline 😂 https://t.co/S5gNBy17hq https://t.co/iALqFAi1c1","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112595132172108143"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112592951603822593"]},"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T17:13:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112592962387415395"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/vPeWi1hv57","end":35,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112592962387415395/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112592951603822593","start":12,"url":"https://t.co/vPeWi1hv57"}]},"id":"2112592962387415395","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":1366,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"interesting https://t.co/vPeWi1hv57","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112592962387415395"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112592207785996289","3_2112592207769157632","3_2112592269588963329"]},"author_id":"34743251","created_at":"2026-10-20T17:10:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112592291147747809"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/StXyXyvdMZ","end":97,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2112592291147747809/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112592207785996289","start":74,"url":"https://t.co/StXyXyvdMZ"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/StXyXyvdMZ","end":97,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2112592291147747809/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112592207769157632","start":74,"url":"https://t.co/StXyXyvdMZ"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/StXyXyvdMZ","end":97,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2112592291147747809/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112592269588963329","start":74,"url":"https://t.co/StXyXyvdMZ"}]},"id":"2112592291147747809","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":78,"impression_count":223271,"like_count":2871,"quote_count":31,"reply_count":188,"retweet_count":327},"text":"Falcon 9 launches the Bandwagon-5 rideshare mission to orbit from Florida https://t.co/StXyXyvdMZ","url":"https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2112592291147747809"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112590799703568647"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/janecoaston/st…","end":304,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/janecoaston/status/2112584517462695949","start":281,"url":"https://t.co/7C0P0UZO8G"}]},"id":"2112590799703568647","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":5628,"like_count":37,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":3},"text":"The difficulty of this whole case is, of course, that the case itself is sealed-- a grand jury case involving a minor!\n\nAnd that, ultimately, while he was charged he was not convicted. Maybe he would have been had he not skipped town.\n\nBut of course, \"CPS took custody away\" isn't https://t.co/7C0P0UZO8G","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112590799703568647"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112587675555205120"]},"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T16:53:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112588075863793841"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":154,"id":"1887207443257528320","start":145,"username":"PeterRFB"},{"end":170,"id":"2351126707","start":155,"username":"DrJasonCarroll"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/lpUDxRrGUp","end":298,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112588075863793841/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112587675555205120","start":275,"url":"https://t.co/lpUDxRrGUp"}]},"id":"2112588075863793841","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":2282,"like_count":41,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":7},"text":"Childless people often feel like the world is constantly telling them to have kids. So it's confusing when people talk about antinatalism.\n\nHere @PeterRFB @DrJasonCarroll and I show some actual data on experiences of antinatal comments!\n\nBigger families get a *lot* of crap! https://t.co/lpUDxRrGUp","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112588075863793841"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T16:38:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112584218580578735"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/kurtsaltrichte…","end":301,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/kurtsaltrichter/status/2112351876184191217","start":278,"url":"https://t.co/BaBq2Lcktw"}]},"id":"2112584218580578735","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2613,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"The issue is sellers don't have tons of incentive to blink, because most sellers also anticipate being buyers. You sell a home to buy a home. And given the high cost of buying a home, you really don't want to take a haircut on selling a home.\n\nThe first dominoes will be second https://t.co/BaBq2Lcktw","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112584218580578735"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T16:35:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112583492664267088"],"id":"2112583492664267088","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1012,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"it's always fun watching Claude find weird quirks in datasets you already knew about, and it's like \"wait, no, seriously, let me double check....\"\n\nvery relatable","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112583492664267088"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T16:27:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112581595471176099"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"And other findings from IFS’ new international survey!","display_url":"lymanstone.substack.com/p/babies-are-n…","end":94,"expanded_url":"https://lymanstone.substack.com/p/babies-are-not-for-cowards",